# Generated training artifacts — never commit run outputs, adapters, or logs.
#
# This list is an allowlist of names, so every NEW generated artifact has to be added
# here deliberately. M62 S3B adds three: the plan-consumption ledger, the quarantine
# tree a failed or interrupted run is moved into, and any checkpoint tree a future
# bounded policy enables. The bare *.jsonl rule is the backstop for the next one
# nobody remembers to list -- a run ledger records which dataset digests an operator
# trained on, and it is reviewed locally rather than published.
runs/
adapters/
logs/
configs/*.json
datasets/
manifests/*.json
quarantine/
checkpoints/
training_runs.jsonl
*.jsonl
*.safetensors

# Keep the directory structure, the docs and the reviewed sample configs tracked.
# A generated run config carries a specific dataset digest and belongs to one operator's
# run; a template carries only REQUIRED_* placeholders and is reviewed like any source
# file, so it is the one JSON here that is committed.
!README.md
!.gitignore
!configs/qwen3-0.6b-lora-smoke.json
